            <img
              class="eppx-shot eppx-finv__shot"
              src="/feature-images/event-payment-processing/gateway-fee-estimates.png"
              alt="EventHex Gateway Fee Estimates with Stripe fee percentage, fixed fee, tax on fees, and platform fee override"
              width="920"
              height="198"
              loading="lazy"
              decoding="async"
            />
            <span class="eppx-shot-float eppx-shot-float--tr eppx-finv__float eppx-finv__float--top">
              <b>✓ Fees and tax kept separate</b>
              <small>Gateway, platform, tax</small>
            </span>
            <span class="eppx-shot-float eppx-shot-float--bl eppx-finv__float">
              <i></i>
              <b>Estimated net payout</b>
