          <p>
            Use the event-level finance view to move from individual orders to an operational summary for the finance team.
          </p>
          <ul class="eppx-finv__measures">
            <li><b>Gross collected</b><span>Review captured value for the selected event context.</span></li>
            <li><b>Refunded</b><span>See returned amounts without treating gross sales as retained revenue.</span></li>
            <li><b>Fees and tax</b><span>Keep estimated gateway fees, platform-fee context, and recorded tax visible as separate fields.</span></li>
            <li><b>Estimated net payout</b><span>Review the calculated event view by currency, status, gateway, and provider before comparing it with processor records.</span></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
